caption: Realized Revelations
tradition-component: realized-revelations

A Realized Revelation may be used as Required Disadvantage on Dreadhound Super-Memorization, using the normal Required Disadvantage value and construction rules. A Latent Revelation cannot provide a point discount. The selected Realized Revelation is part of the purchased Super-Memorization build and is not changed merely by switching Current Prey or loading a different ability.
